Scheduling

Interviews should be scheduled with members of the Oxide team. <span style="color: #db89c8;">We ask candidates to provide at least nine hours of time</span>, generally over three three-hour blocks consisting of three slots of one hour each. To schedule interviews, Oxide employees will book an interview slot, opting into conversations with the candidate as they see fit. Some candidates may wish to provide more such blocks, and in rare cases, we may ask for more blocks. We try to balance respect for the candidate’s time with our desire to be thorough, and we have generally found nine hours of interviews to be sufficient without being overly burdensome.